  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A gouache painting in a spiral sketchbook of a small striped rainbow cactus in a red pot, with a faint shadow of a larger cactus bleeding through the page.",
    "description": "A square photograph of a spiral bound sketchbook page on a wooden table. A small cactus with a yellow, green, orange and blue striped body and three short teal and pink tipped arms sits in a terracotta red pot at the centre of the page. Around it, the ghost of a larger cactus from the other side of the sheet shows through the paper as a faint grey shape with many arms. The pot and cactus are outlined in black with streaky gouache fills.",
    "impression": "A tiny potted cactus with the shadow of its giant ancestor haunting the page behind it. The bleed through is an accident that became the best part, a reminder of the previous drawing. Small, sweet and a little funny.",
